{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SnapNote 是一款主打隱私保護的離線 AI 掃描應用，適合重視數據安全及需要頻繁整理文件的人士。該 App 目前限時免費，原價為 US $0.99。用戶無需註冊帳號或訂閱服務，即可在裝置本地端完成所有處理工作，有效避免雲端上傳風險與額外費用。</p>\n\n<h2>離線AI識別與結構化筆記</h2>\n<p>SnapNote 利用裝置端 AI 模型進行文字識別與內容組織，將掃描圖像轉換為可編輯、搜尋且具結構化的筆記。它超越傳統 OCR，能保留原始圖片並自動分類標題、段落及表格。支援多頁管理、裁剪旋轉及標籤整理，協助用戶建立個人知識庫。完成後可匯出 Markdown、PDF 等多種格式，實現高效無間斷的文件數位化管理。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-135-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SnapNote: Offline AI Scanner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T16:22:45.862087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}